OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786915120
OL,3,CCar packed with laughing gas canisters
OL,4,Cseized by police
OL,6,FPolice have found a large quantity of
OL,7,Fnitrous oxide, known as laughing gas,
OL,8,Fin a car in Gravesend.
OL,10,FIt was seized by officers following
OL,11,Freports from residents about a
OL,12,Fsuspicious vehicle on Doria Drive,
OL,13,Fwhich had been parked for several
OL,14,Fweeks.
OL,16,FTwenty five boxes of nitrous oxide
OL,17,Fwere hidden beneath a tarpaulin sheet
OL,18,Fon the vehicle's back seat on
OL,19,FThursday, 13th August 2026.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/3
