OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786915120
OL,3,CCar packed with laughing gas canisters
OL,4,Cseized by police
OL,6,FA property linked to the car's
OL,7,Fregistered owner was searched and
OL,8,Fmultiple mobile phones, around #2,000
OL,9,Fin cash and a further six boxes of
OL,10,Fnitrous oxide were seized.
OL,12,FA 19-year-old man from Gravesend has
OL,13,Farrested on suspicion of drug offences.
OL,15,FHe has since been released on bail
OL,16,Fwhile enquiries continue.
OL,18,FThe NHS says nitrous oxide is a
OL,19,Fdissociative drug with anaesthetic and
OL,20,Fpsychedelic properties.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/3
