OL,3,CCar packed with laughing gas canisters
OL,4,Cseized by police
OL,6,FIt is a colourless and odourless
OL,7,Fsubstance that's also known as
OL,8,F"laughing gas."
OL,10,FWhen inhaled, the gas slows down the
OL,11,Fbody's reaction time.
OL,13,FThe effects usually last around 5-15
OL,14,Fminutes.
